--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Portions adapted from SAP's gorfc
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Go binding layer in gorfc/ is adapted from:

    https://github.com/SAP-archive/gorfc
    gorfc/gorfc.go and gorfc/gorfc_test.go
    Copyright (c) SAP SE
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

A copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 is available at:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The adapted code is the binding's use of the SAP NW RFC C API -- the Go type
mapping, the parameter-filling and result-wrapping shape, and the public API
this package reproduces. It carries no knowledge of the RFC wire protocol.
erpl-proto's implementation of that protocol is clean-room, derived solely
from this project's own captures of libsapnwrfc, and nothing in the adapted
code informs it.

